@startuml runtime-view-leaderboard
title PacMan - Runtime: View the leaderboard without login

actor Player as player
participant "API Client" as apiclient
participant "Leaderboard Endpoint" as leaderboardendpoint
participant "Repository" as repo
participant "Game Database" as db

player -> apiclient: Open the leaderboard
apiclient -> leaderboardendpoint: Request ranked scores (HTTPS/JSON)
note over apiclient, leaderboardendpoint: No ID token is sent or required.

leaderboardendpoint -> repo: Read ranked scores
repo -> db: Select scores ordered by score (SQL)
db --> repo: Score rows
repo --> leaderboardendpoint: Leaderboard entries
leaderboardendpoint --> apiclient: Return ranked scores (HTTPS/JSON)
apiclient --> player: Display leaderboard

@enduml
